Changes implement the Trusted Extensions functionality in libcupsfilters.
Banner pages on labeled systems are produced by the custom labeltops filter.
Document labels are rendered by the PDFio-based pdftopdf filter.

This patch together with tx.patch in cups and cups-filters makes the
Trusted Extensions implementation complete.
